---
title: "Configuration"
description: "QQL configuration — inference modes (cloud, local, external), embedding setup, config file location, and all connect flags."
sidebar:
  order: 4
---

QQL stores connection config in `~/.qql/config.json`. It is written at `connect` time and read on every subsequent command.

## Inference Modes

| Mode | Dense vectors | Sparse vectors | Use when |
|------|--------------|----------------|----------|
| `cloud` | Qdrant Cloud server-side inference | Qdrant Cloud | Running on Qdrant Cloud |
| `local` | Local OpenAI-compatible API | Repo BM25 + Qdrant sparse IDF | Self-hosted Qdrant + local embeddings (LM Studio, Ollama, llamafile) |
| `external` | Remote OpenAI-compatible API | Same as local | Remote Qdrant + remote embedding service |

## Connect Flags

| Flag | Default | Description |
|------|---------|-------------|
| `--url` | — | Qdrant gRPC URL. **Must use port 6334**, not 6333. |
| `--secret` | — | Qdrant API key (Qdrant Cloud) |
| `--inference-mode` | `cloud` | `cloud`, `local`, or `external` |
| `--embedding-endpoint` | — | OpenAI-compatible `/v1/embeddings` URL (local/external mode) |
| `--embedding-key` | — | Bearer token for hosted embedding providers (optional) |
| `--embedding-model` | — | Model name sent in the embeddings request |
| `--embedding-dimension` | auto | Vector dimension. Auto-probed if reachable. |

## Cloud Mode

{% terminal title="Cloud connect" %}
qql-go connect --url https://<cluster>.qdrant.io --secret <api-key>
{% /terminal %}

Qdrant Cloud handles all vectorization server-side. No embedding endpoint needed.

## Local Mode

{% terminal title="Local connect (macOS / Linux)" %}
qql-go connect \
  --url http://localhost:6334 \
  --inference-mode local \
  --embedding-endpoint http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1/embeddings \
  --embedding-key <optional-api-key> \
  --embedding-model text-embedding-all-minilm-l6-v2-embedding \
  --embedding-dimension 384
{% /terminal %}

{% terminal title="Local connect (Windows)" %}
qql-go connect `
  --url http://localhost:6334 `
  --inference-mode local `
  --embedding-endpoint http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1/embeddings `
  --embedding-model text-embedding-all-minilm-l6-v2-embedding
{% /terminal %}

{% aside type="note" title="Auto-detect dimension" %}

`--embedding-dimension` is optional if the embedding endpoint is reachable. QQL will probe it automatically and save the detected dimension.

{% /aside %}

Compatible embedding servers: **LM Studio**, **Ollama**, **llamafile**, **Cohere**, **OpenAI**, or any server that implements the `/v1/embeddings` API.

## External Mode

{% terminal title="External connect" %}
qql-go connect \
  --url https://your-qdrant.example.com:6334 \
  --secret <qdrant-api-key> \
  --inference-mode external \
  --embedding-endpoint https://api.openai.com/v1/embeddings \
  --embedding-key sk-... \
  --embedding-model text-embedding-3-small
{% /terminal %}

## Config File

The config file lives at `~/.qql/config.json`. File permissions are `0o600` (contains secrets).

{% aside type="tip" title="Example config" %}

```json
{
  "url": "http://localhost:6334",
  "inference_mode": "local",
  "embedding_endpoint": "http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1/embeddings",
  "embedding_model": "text-embedding-all-minilm-l6-v2-embedding",
  "embedding_dimension": 384,
  "bm25": {
    "k1": 1.5,
    "b": 0.75,
    "avgdl": 100
  }
}
```

{% /aside %}

### BM25 Parameters

For local/external mode, BM25 parameters can be tuned in the config:

| Parameter | Default | Description |
|-----------|---------|-------------|
| `k1` | `1.5` | Term frequency saturation |
| `b` | `0.75` | Length normalization |
| `avgdl` | `100` | Average document length |

## Disconnect

{% terminal title="Disconnect" %}
qql-go disconnect
{% /terminal %}

Removes the stored config. Subsequent commands will require reconnection.

## Doctor

{% terminal title="Health check" %}
qql-go doctor
qql-go doctor --quiet --json
{% /terminal %}

## Feature Support by Mode

| Feature | Cloud | Local | External |
|---------|-------|-------|----------|
| Dense insert/search | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Hybrid insert/search | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Sparse-only search | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| RERANK | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Recommend | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
